---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="日本語 · Japan IT / AI Daily">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">JLPT + IT日本語</div><h1>日本語学习</h1><p>从每日推荐文章中提取 JLPT 词汇、语法和 IT/AI 专业表达，按参考等级整理。</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-two">
    <div class="panel"><h3>JLPT 词汇</h3><p>N5/N4、N3、N2、N1 参考等级。JMdict/EDICT 用于辅助校对读音、词性与基本释义。</p></div>
    <div class="panel"><h3>IT / AI 日本語</h3><p>MCP、RAG、Runtime、認証、認可、脆弱性、可観測性等专业表达单独整理。</p></div>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
